meta {
  name: 2b. Discover All Offers
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/offers
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Telegram-Init-Data: {{initDataB}}
}

docs {
  No provider_id at all -> the marketplace-wide browse view: every
  ACTIVE offer from every provider. This is what a buyer who doesn't
  already know a specific provider's id would use (previously there was
  no way to do this at all — see TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENTS.md's "Customer
  Discovery").

  Never includes anyone's INACTIVE offers, even your own — use "2. List
  Offers" with your own provider_id for that.
}
